---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "August 2026";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms governing use of Pixelquil's free browser-based tools."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">
      Terms of Service
    </span>

    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          By accessing or using Pixelquil ("the site," "we," "us"), you agree to be bound by
          these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Description of service</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil provides free, browser-based tools for SVG editing, frontend development
          utilities, and technical SEO checks. Tools process data locally in your browser; no
          account is required to use core functionality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">You agree not to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>Use the site for any unlawful purpose, or to process content you do not have the right to use.</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or gain unauthorized access to the site's infrastructure.</li>
          <li>Scrape, reverse engineer, or republish the site's tools as your own without permission.</li>
          <li>Use automated systems to abuse tool functionality in a way that degrades service for others.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. Ownership of your content</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You retain full ownership of any file, code, text, or image you process using
          Pixelquil's tools. Since processing happens locally in your browser, we never receive,
          store, or claim any right to your content.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Pixelquil's tools are provided "as is" and "as available," without warranty of any
          kind, express or implied, including but not limited to accuracy, reliability, or
          fitness for a particular purpose. Generated output (calculated values, converted files,
          generated code, and similar) should be independently verified before use in any
          production, legal, financial, or otherwise critical context.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Pixelquil and its operator shall not be liable
          for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use
          of, or inability to use, the site or its tools, including damages resulting from
          reliance on generated output.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">7. Third-party services and advertising</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This site may display advertising served by Google AdSense and may link to or embed
          third-party services (such as Formspree for contact forms). We are not responsible for
          the content, policies, or practices of third-party services.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">8. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The Pixelquil name, logo, site design, and original tool implementations are the
          property of Pixelquil. You may not copy, redistribute, or create derivative products
          based on Pixelquil's tools without permission.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">9. Changes to the service</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We may modify, suspend, or discontinue any tool or feature at any time, with or without
          notice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">10. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes
          are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">11. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Questions about these terms can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:hello@pixelquil.com" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">hello@pixelquil.com</a>
          or through our <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>